WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.847 --> 00:00:05.205
Type an organization, JetBrains, and press Scan

2
00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:09.007
Each of its repositories scanned in turn, with a progress bar

3
00:00:09.007 --> 00:00:10.241
7 skills in 3 of 5 repositories, most skills first

4
00:00:10.241 --> 00:00:12.475
The skills cluster by themselves, with haiku: no button to press

5
00:00:12.475 --> 00:00:13.723
The bar moves on as haiku’s answer streams in

6
00:00:13.723 --> 00:00:17.779
7 skills in 3 clusters: Build, Docs and Review, each with its count

7
00:00:17.779 --> 00:00:21.035
Open Build: build, lint and release, each linked to its SKILL.md, with its repository

8
00:00:21.035 --> 00:00:24.683
Open Docs: a, b and c, from JetBrains/idea

9
00:00:24.683 --> 00:00:27.933
And Review: review, from JetBrains/android. Every skill in exactly one cluster
